sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor BM as Band Member
    participant UI as WebClient
    participant API as BandController
    participant BS as BandService
    participant BR as BandRepository
    participant IR as InstrumentRepository
    Note over BM,IR: Scenario 10 - Band associates Instruments idempotently
    BM->>UI: addInstruments([Guitar, Drums])
    activate UI
    UI->>API: PUT /bands/{id}/instruments
    activate API
    API->>BS: addInstruments(bandId, instrumentIds)
    activate BS
    BS->>BR: findById(bandId)
    activate BR
    BR-->>BS: Band
    deactivate BR
    loop for each requested Instrument
        BS->>IR: findById(instrumentId)
        activate IR
        IR-->>BS: Instrument
        deactivate IR
        BS->>BR: associateInstrumentIfAbsent(bandId, instrumentId)
        activate BR
        BR-->>BS: inserted or alreadyAssociated
        deactivate BR
    end
    BS-->>API: InstrumentsAssociated()
    API-->>UI: 200 OK
    UI-->>BM: displayBandInstruments([Guitar, Drums])
    deactivate BS
    deactivate API
    deactivate UI